Package: rbesd
Title: Tools for WHO/UNICEF BeSD Quantitative Data Preparation, Analysis, and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Alexandre", family = "de Figueiredo",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "alex.defigueiredo@lshtm.ac.uk"))
Description: Provides a standardised workflow to prepare, validate, summarise, visualise,
    and model WHO/UNICEF Behavioural and Social Drivers (BeSD) quantitative toolkit data.
    Includes a harmonised item dictionary, plotting utilities, regression wrappers 
    (frequentist and Bayesian; single-level and multilevel; binary and ordinal outcomes),
    scoring/summaries to support routine analyses, as well as country fact-sheet makers.
